---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber off
    actor Steward
    participant Page as SIR on the Site page<br/>SirPdfExportButton
    participant Api as API routes<br/>/api/pdf
    participant Job as Background job<br/>processPdfJob
    participant DB as Supabase DB
    participant S3 as AWS S3

    Note over Steward,S3: Covers US 7.0.1. Built in PR #155 (closes #68). All steps exist on main as of October 11, 2026.

    Steward->>Page: Select Export PDF on own SIR<br/>(shown to the submitter and to Admins)
    Page->>Api: POST /api/pdf {mode single, responseId,<br/>options includeImages true, hiddenQuestionIds []}
    Api->>Api: auth.getUser(). Approved Admin or approved steward?
    alt Not approved, or not Admin or steward
        Api-->>Page: 403 'Forbidden - steward or admin access required'
    else Steward
        alt mode is site or multi-site
            Api-->>Page: 403 'Forbidden - stewards can only export their own reports'
        else hiddenQuestionIds is not empty (US 7.0.7 AT4)
            Api-->>Page: 403 'Forbidden - only admins can hide fields on export'
        else
            Api->>DB: form_responses.user_id of responseId (service role)
            DB-->>Api: Owner user_id or no row
            alt Caller did not submit the SIR (AT 2)
                Api-->>Page: 403 'Forbidden - you can only export reports you submitted'.<br/>No job is made
                Page-->>Steward: Show the error under the button
            end
        end
    end
    opt Caller is Admin, or the steward owns the SIR
        Api->>DB: Insert S26_pdf_jobs row, status pending (signed-in client, RLS: created_by = caller)
        Api-->>Page: 202 with jobId
        Api->>Job: after(): processPdfJob(jobId)
        Job->>DB: fetchReportData: answers and attachments
        Job->>S3: Get photos
        Job->>Job: Render PDF (lib/pdf/inspectionReport)
        loop Every 2.5 s, at most 3 minutes
            Page->>Api: GET /api/pdf/status/{jobId}
            Api->>DB: Read job. RLS returns it only to its creator. The route checks created_by again
            Api-->>Page: status, and downloadUrl when complete
        end
        alt Render or upload fails
            Job->>DB: Set job failed with error
            Page-->>Steward: Show the error under the button
        else PDF is made
            Job->>S3: Put PDF
            Job->>DB: Set job complete with storage_path
            Page-->>Steward: PdfJobWatcher (root layout) downloads the PDF<br/>with the same answers and photos as the SIR page (AT 1, AT 3)
        end
    end
